### Invalid same-account transfer
POST https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbx2fZsDgM3RCFVkSQhM1ai4kr4kyc7AbTfWUP1QWdwZhQwmhdqX_ZG03WDQhsIm5IyC/exec
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "CREATE_TRANSACTION",
  "data": {
    "transactionType": "TRANSFER",
    "transactionDate": "21-09-2026",
    "amount": 100,
    "fromAccountId": "ACC001",
    "toAccountId": "ACC001",
    "notes": "same account"
  }
}

### Expected output
{
  "success": false,
  "error": {
    "code": "INVALID_TRANSFER_ACCOUNT",
    "message": "From and To accounts must be different."
  }
}
